<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>point forwards and downwards,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρος ὁ ποὺς ἧσσόν τι -κύπτειν
				ἐθέλει ἐς τοὔμπροσθεν</span> (in dislocations) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stick one's head out, peep out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ δίφρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					64.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά τινων ὀπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.350
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				364
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς καλύβης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					116.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>peep out, emerge,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξω τείχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			; of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτθίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					415
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶττα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνίδιον ἐκ τοῦ ἱματίου π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Merc. Cond.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὠδίνων προὔκυψε τὸ βρέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Gaur.</u>
					16.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.65
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ νοητικὸν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lysis
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				17.77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα π. ἀπὸ τῆς συνῃρημένης φύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἄκρων τῶν χειλῶν π. τις
				λόγος</span> (prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Medic.,
				<i>suffer from prolapsus,</i> of the iris, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.716
			</span></i>; of the omentum, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(1).97
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>flow out,</i> of water, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				104.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stoop before,</i> of a hunchback, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ προεστάναι τῆς πόλεως, ἀλλὰ
					προκεκυφέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.633d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
